 "beats": [
  {
   "type": "title",
   "speaker": "q",
   "scene": "globe",
   "text": "Why is Istanbul's busiest square named after water?"
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "Because taksim means division. It is where the city's water was divided."
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "q",
   "text": "Wasn't Istanbul surrounded by water already?",
   "scene": "citywater",
   "date": "Today",
   "place": "Istanbul"
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "By salt water, yes. Fresh water had to come from the forests to the north."
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "The Romans built the Valens Aqueduct in the three hundreds. Its arches still cross the old city.",
   "scene": "aqueduct",
   "date": "4th century",
   "place": "Valens Aqueduct",
   "move": {
    "from": [
     0.5,
     0.5,
     1.0
    ],
    "to": [
     0.6,
     0.5,
     1.25
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "And they stored water in huge underground cisterns, like this one.",
   "scene": "cistern",
   "date": "6th century",
   "place": "Basilica Cistern",
   "move": {
    "from": [
     0.5,
     0.5,
     1.0
    ],
    "to": [
     0.5,
     0.45,
     1.3
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "q",
   "text": "And the Ottomans?",
   "scene": "start",
   "date": "1730",
   "place": "Ottoman lands"
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "They kept the old system running and added to it. Under Suleiman, the architect Sinan brought new lines from the Belgrade Forest."
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "In the 1730s, Sultan Mahmud the First turned to the hills north of Galata, where there was little water.",
   "scene": "mahmud",
   "date": "1730s",
   "place": "Istanbul",
   "move": {
    "from": [
     0.5,
     0.4,
     1.0
    ],
    "to": [
     0.5,
     0.32,
     1.3
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "He had water brought from the Belgrade Forest, along channels and pipes, toward the city.",
   "scene": "maksem3d",
   "shot": "aerial"
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "It ran down to a hilltop outside Galata.",
   "scene": "maksem3d",
   "shot": "pipe"
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "There, it gathered in an eight-sided stone building: the Taksim maksem.",
   "scene": "maksem3d",
   "shot": "maksem",
   "say": "There, it gathered in an eight-sided stone building: the Taksim maksem."
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "q",
   "text": "And then?",
   "scene": "maksem3d",
   "shot": "split"
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "Then it was divided into three branches, for Galata, Tophane and Kasımpaşa.",
   "scene": "taksimmap",
   "date": "1730s",
   "place": "Taksim",
   "say": "Then it was divided into three branches, for Galata, Topha-neh and Kasim-pasha."
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "q",
   "text": "Is the building still there?",
   "scene": "maksemtoday",
   "date": "Today",
   "place": "Taksim",
   "move": {
    "from": [
     0.5,
     0.5,
     1.0
    ],
    "to": [
     0.5,
     0.45,
     1.25
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "Right. It still stands on the corner of Taksim Square, and the square kept its name."
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "q",
   "text": "Did the empire change under Mahmud?",
   "scene": "end",
   "date": "1739",
   "place": "Ottoman lands"
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "A little. In 1739, he won back Belgrade from Austria."
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "Next time: the last Ottoman march on Vienna, in 1683. Like the video and follow History Sketches."
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "q",
   "text": "And tell us in the comments what you think!"
  },
  {
   "type": "end",
   "text": "Next: Vienna, 1683",
   "sub": "Follow History Sketches"
  }
 ]
}